      "role": "user",
      "content": "just finished a 14 hour shift and i’m sitting in my car in the hospital parking lot. i cant even bring myself to start the engine. spent the last three hours watching people fight for lives that dont even seem worth saving. it’s just one after another. i feel like i'm just trying to scoop up the ocean with a spoon. it's all so pointless.",
